# THE NEW DEPLOYMENT on Base (step D of work/plans/join-template-commit-reveal.md):
# `pnpm build alpha2` once `contracts/deployments/alpha2` exists (Step D-live).
# The app's RPC and the one handed to wallets: Base's public endpoint. A keyed
# provider can replace PUBLIC_NODE_URL in a `.env.alpha2.local`; never put a
# keyed url in PUBLIC_CHAIN_INFO_NODE_URL, which every wallet receives.
PUBLIC_NODE_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
PUBLIC_CHAIN_INFO_NODE_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
# The hosted reveal scheduler, which must answer 0.12.1 or later at `GET /`
# (`@fuzd/client` 0.12: batch schedules, `cycle_<n>_<game>` slots). Timelocked
# to drand on this chain.
PUBLIC_FUZD_URI=https://api.fuzd.dev
